        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"104be1dc-198b-46b5-949e-d61f65b4bfd2\",\"review_text\":\"This is soo good app I love this.. Guys instilled this app and make money and enjoy music\"},{\"review_id\":\"aa3d668e-f8e0-4337-8938-c4b06cd679d8\",\"review_text\":\"It was a 5 but thay messed it up with the new update.\"},{\"review_id\":\"ca50fb15-3e6c-43c3-b0c7-efacd6b35eb2\",\"review_text\":\"Great platform to listen music but ads will disturb\"},{\"review_id\":\"cc9ce1d9-a60b-4f1d-be4b-17b453e46d1d\",\"review_text\":\"Worst update .\"},{\"review_id\":\"9dff8e28-fe1d-435a-a6af-b81e6a5e24f2\",\"review_text\":\"As a lover of music..I love it. It's the best\"},{\"review_id\":\"8b53f1f2-bac2-426a-ba14-2a8b140fddaf\",\"review_text\":\"Ok so I love this song called Overclock and now it's not playing anymore. What did y'all do? Why are some songs \\\"band\\\" or not playeble that makes no sense.\"},{\"review_id\":\"e5635b9a-b57f-4a87-ba48-142e0a06575b\",\"review_text\":\"New interface is terrible. They tried to make it like tik tok and it autoplays at whatever volume it pleases. This might be what pushes me over the edge to another service after years of them removing useful features.\"},{\"review_id\":\"fd9d8645-15b6-4fe0-a878-9d91501e42d3\",\"review_text\":\"With addition of AI Spotify is on another level.\"},{\"review_id\":\"46796c2f-d452-43f8-a66b-ae813b228892\",\"review_text\":\"Did the app crash????? I cannot get in touch with spoitify nor can I login my acct\"},{\"review_id\":\"e5663928-7076-4fda-ac53-5dc95046a3d9\",\"review_text\":\"🔥🔥\"}]}"
